# Per-Dockerfile .dockerignore for `-f mayhem/Dockerfile` builds. BuildKit
# gives this file full precedence over the context-root .dockerignore.
#
# Upstream's OWN root .dockerignore excludes `.git` and `.github` (tuned for
# their own deploy image) — left alone, `docker build -f mayhem/Dockerfile .`
# would strip the git history and workflow files out of the build context,
# and the image would fail SPEC §6.2 item 2 ("full repo incl .git baked in").
# This override re-includes everything except real build-artifact/editor
# cruft (docs/netnew-worker-prompt.md §4b).

# ── Build outputs / local cruft ──────────────────────────────────────────────
**/target
mayhem-build/
*.o
*.a
*.so

# ── Editor / OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
